00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.901
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.002
We're hanging out with
Jamie Dornan.

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.236
And we are about to play
another edition of

00:00:04.236 --> 00:00:06.039
"Like, Follow, Block."

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:07.506
-♪ Like, follow, block ♪

00:00:07.506 --> 00:00:09.375
-♪ Yeah ♪
-♪ Like, follow, block ♪

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:11.377
-♪ Yeah ♪
-♪ Like, follow, block ♪

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:13.246
-♪ Yeah ♪
-♪ Like, follow, block ♪

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:14.380
-♪ Yeah! ♪

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.082
-Alright. Now, to start off,
I'm I'm going to

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:18.017
give you three choices, and
you're gonna have to tell me,

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:21.521
out of the three, which would
you like a post from,

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.523
which one you'd follow,
and which one you would block.

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:26.892
Sound good?
-I've got this.

00:00:26.892 --> 00:00:30.096 line:0%
-Alright, let's see
the first three options.

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:39.805 line:0%
-That's alarmingly easy for me.
-Oh, really?

00:00:39.805 --> 00:00:41.141 line:0%
-Yeah, it is.

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:44.477 line:0%
So, straightaway --
like, follow, block --

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:45.478 line:0%
blocking Bailey's.

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:47.513 line:0%
I just do not understand
Bailey's at all.

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:50.416 line:0%
I don't understand why it's --

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:53.819 line:0%
Bailey's should be blocked
for life, for good, forever.

00:00:53.819 --> 00:00:56.122 line:0%
-It's like Irish eggnog.

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:58.824 line:0%
-No, it's sickening.

00:00:58.824 --> 00:01:01.694 line:0%
I, like -- Don't get me
started on Bailey's.

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:06.599 line:0%
Jameson I'm going to like,
'cause I do. I like it.

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:09.001 line:0%
And, yeah, I'm gonna follow --

00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:13.773 line:0%
I would follow Guinness
anywhere it leads me. Yeah.

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:16.909 line:0%
-"I would follow Guinness
anywhere it leads me"

00:01:16.909 --> 00:01:18.678 line:0%
should actually be
the slogan for Guinness.

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:20.212 line:0%
That is fantastic.

00:01:20.212 --> 00:01:21.948 line:0%
Next round, we have...

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:32.058 line:0%
-Okay.
-Are you a "Friends" fan?

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:35.662 line:0%
-Yeah. Yeah, I mean, listen,
I feel like everyone

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:36.962 line:0%
kind of is a "Friends" fan,

00:01:36.962 --> 00:01:38.798 line:0%
and I feel like I must have
seen every "Friends."

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:40.866 line:0%
And we do a thing sometimes,
my wife and I.

00:01:40.866 --> 00:01:44.336 line:0%
If we want to watch, like,
a really serious series

00:01:44.336 --> 00:01:46.972 line:0%
but we're eating, we'll be like,
"Why don't we just

00:01:46.972 --> 00:01:48.708 line:0%
stick 'Friends' on
while we wait."

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:50.242 line:0%
That's, like, our thing.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:01:50.242 --> 00:01:52.845 line:0%
-So I always eat during
"Friends."

00:01:52.845 --> 00:01:56.916 line:0%
-That's so funny.

00:01:56.916 --> 00:02:01.187 line:0%
-You know, I'm quite classic in
my "Friends" appreciation.

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:05.258 line:0%
So I'm going to follow
Ross and Rachel.

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:08.161 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:12.198 line:0%
-Chandler and Monica
will get a like.

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:14.033 line:0%
-Wow.

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:17.803 line:0%
-And it's actually nothing
against Joey and Phoebe,

00:02:17.803 --> 00:02:20.206 line:0%
but, yeah, I'm blocking them.

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.241 line:0%
-Yeah, it's a tough choice.
I understand.

00:02:22.241 --> 00:02:24.177 line:0%
We have to do
another round here.

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:25.612 line:0%
We got...

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:32.985 line:0%
-Wow.
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:32.985 --> 00:02:35.254 line:0%
-What is the lesser of
these three evils?

00:02:35.254 --> 00:02:36.622 line:0%
[ Both laugh ]

00:02:36.622 --> 00:02:39.258 line:0%
I guess I'll follow Instagram,
because I'm on there.

00:02:39.258 --> 00:02:41.327 line:0%
I'll like Twitter
because I used to be on there.

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:42.395 line:0%
And I'll block Facebook

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:45.597 line:0%
'cause I have no
experience in Facebook.

00:02:45.597 --> 00:02:48.568 line:0%
-I love the honesty.
I appreciate it. I get it.

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:50.102 line:0%
Last round.

00:02:50.102 --> 00:02:51.503 line:0%
I'm going to pronounce these
the way I think

00:02:51.503 --> 00:02:52.672 line:0%
they should be pronounced.

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:56.575 line:0%
We have Batmin, Spider-min,
and Iron Min.

00:02:56.575 --> 00:02:59.245 line:0%
Am I pronouncing it wrong?

00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:01.914 line:0%
-It works for me.
It works for me.

00:03:01.914 --> 00:03:05.250 line:0%
-Batman, Spider-man, Iron Man.
-Oh, wow. Okay.

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.221 line:0%
-Like, follow, block.

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:10.790 line:0%
-I'm gonna -- I wouldn't want
to block Batman.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:16.229 line:0%
I'm most scared of him of
the three of the them.

00:03:16.229 --> 00:03:19.632 line:0%
So he's gonna --
You know, I'll follow him.

00:03:19.632 --> 00:03:24.337 line:0%
Spider-man I am going to like.

00:03:24.337 --> 00:03:28.807 line:0%
And I'm gonna block Iron Man
because I just don't like what

00:03:28.807 --> 00:03:30.943 line:0%
he's doing in that image there.

00:03:30.943 --> 00:03:32.011 line:0%
I don't like that.

00:03:32.011 --> 00:03:34.180 line:0%
He's super-aggressive
in that image,

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.881 line:0%
and I'm like, "No, thanks."

00:03:35.881 --> 00:03:38.050 line:0%
[ Both laugh ]

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.518 line:0%
-He is a bit intimidating.

00:03:39.518 --> 00:03:41.520 line:0%
Like, You don't want to have
that dude at a party right now.

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:43.822 line:0%
But, yet, in real life,
he's fun,

00:03:43.822 --> 00:03:46.392 line:0%
but at that moment --
Yeah, from the picture alone,

00:03:46.392 --> 00:03:48.227 line:0%
I totally agree
with these choices.

00:03:48.227 --> 00:03:49.428 line:0%
Jamie Dornan, everybody.

00:03:49.428 --> 00:03:51.997 line:0%
"Wild Mountain Thyme"
is out December 11th.

00:03:51.997 --> 00:03:53.132 line:0%
Thank you so much
for being here, pal.

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:54.267 line:0%
It's always good to see you.

